{{Quote|Provides spinning attacks which will injure enemies with razor sharp wind slashes.|Shop}}
'''Spin''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|7,500}} or {{Robux|75}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Spin allows the user to spin rapidly, turning the air into sharp and fast attacks that can stun and damage opponents.

